  description="饮用水处理系统可配置反渗透、过滤、软化和杀菌工艺，适用于瓶装水和饮料生产用水。"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <section class="wt-hero">
    <div class="wt-hero-bg"></div><div class="wt-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="wt-hero-inner">
      <div class="wt-breadcrumb"><a href="/">首页</a><span>/</span><a href="/products/">产品中心</a><span>/</span><span>水处理</span></div>
